  "policy": "Official sources only. The monitor stores an article index (number, heading, page, short excerpt, keywords) and links to the original; it does not republish documents. Notifications stay F1/WEC only; indexing covers every series listed here.",
  "phases": {
    "1": "Tier 1: public dated listings readable with a plain HTTP fetch (this file).",
    "2": "Tier 2: JS-rendered noticeboards (ELMS/ALMS, Formula E, BTCC, Supercars) via a headless browser, undated pages via content hashes, per-event discovery (WRC, DTM, NLS).",
    "3": "History beyond the current and next rulebook year is not crawled by default (decided 2026-11-06); effort goes to current rules, upcoming race documents and automotive technology/patent monitoring instead. Older issues are indexed only when already listed with current ones.",
    "4": "Tier 3: login-only or unpublished rulebooks are listed as unavailable, never guessed."
  },
